"""Money primitives.

The ledger stores every amount as an integer number of minor units so that
no binary floating point drift can accumulate.

This module also owns the single definition of what a *usable* price is:
the spreadsheet exporter writes an empty numeric cell as the literal text
``nan``, and such a placeholder must never reach the settlement engine.
